<title>USA: Schering-Plough, Pharmacopeia at milestone.</title>
<headline>Schering-Plough, Pharmacopeia at milestone.</headline>
<text>
<p>PRINCETON, N.J., March 11 (Reuter) Pharmacopeia Inc Tuesday said a research milestone has been reached in its collaboration program with Schering-Plough Corp in the area of cancer therapy.</p>
<p>The company said the milestone involves Schering-Plough's decision to pursue medicinal chemical development on a lead compound identified by Pharmacopeia.  As a result of achieving this milestone, Schering-Plough has provided Pharmacopeia with a cash payment consistent with the terms of its agreement with Pharmacopeia. Specific terms of the milestone payment have not been disclosed.</p>
</text>
